{"kind": "mod", "id": 1895, "name": "[SAIN] Twitch Players", "slug": "sain-twitch-players", "teaser": "EFT was never forgiving. So are they.", "owner_name": "harmony", "downloads": 31135, "favourites": 22, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "MIT License", "guid": "com.twitchplayers", "thumbnail_local": null, "category": "Bots", "category_id": 5, "updated_at": "2026-07-30T23:38:52.000000Z", "created_at": "2024-12-17T08:58:03.000000Z", "published_at": "2026-01-09T01:09:00.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "4.0.11", "latest_version": "3.0.8", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "https://choosealicense.com/licenses/mit/", "description_html": "<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/harmonyzt/twitchplayers.github.io/e35307acc0fbe5d94bb2c4620db3ee9ad85707dd/media/twitchPlayers.gif\" alt=\"gif\" /></p>\n<div class=\"tabset\"><div id=\"tabset-1-panel-1\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Introduction</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><h3><em>You WILL die.</em></h3>\n<p>Does exactly what you’re thinking. Adds PMCs and PSCAVs with the names of Twitch streamers into your raids with significantly harder AI overall.</p>\n<h3>Main differences between Death Wish Preset</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>SCAVs are as close as possible to live behavior, they no longer kill PMCs at the start of the raid, leaving your raid empty.</li>\n<li>Generally much harder PMCs, including Bosses and Rogues/Raiders.</li>\n<li>No constant head-eyes for both side of Project Fika and SPT players. AI always (mostly, but still <strong>will</strong> hit your head) aims center mass, and if you have no issues, you can turn off “Always Aim Center Mass” inside Global Settings - all head aim chances are pre-configured for this scenario.</li>\n<li>Per-Map configurations for Labs/Factory/Lighthouse due sizes of the map</li>\n<li>Personality-Focused Progression - early wipe you won’t be able to meet hard PMCs or tell much difference, the game will be going just fine like with any other preset. Preset reaches full potential at PMC Level 30-40 due Personalities being locked behind much higher level requirement for AI.</li>\n<li>Twitch Players - AI PMCs with TTV/TV/YT or any other streaming platform inside their name will cause real trouble for you. They use reserved SAIN Personality made specifically for them to be able to act <strong>way</strong> faster. Their reaction time (based from tests) can range from ~100 to ~200ms (<em>slightly</em> less than average human being). Goons, and some bosses like Killa also inherit that personality by default.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enjoy.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Disclaimer: Some of the settings won’t correspond to what you’re actually seeing in the game if you use Fika Project/Headless. Some might experience instant head-eyes, some won’t. I have no fix for this. This Preset is heavily FPS dependent. The worse performance you get (looking at you, Headless Client hosters), the worse is your experience. This Mod&amp;Preset is not made for everyone. You perfectly know what you’re subscribing for by installing this mod. Or about to.. Find out.</p>\n</blockquote></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Bots are too hard?</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://media1.tenor.com/m/QyJuBax5RG4AAAAC/suntzu-osu.gif\" alt=\"suntzu-osu.gif\" /></p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Showcase</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"wAKJav8bqq0\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/wAKJav8bqq0?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/wAKJav8bqq0/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div>\n<div class=\"youtube-lite\" data-video-id=\"88Cu_DiZ9YY\" data-embed-url=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/88Cu_DiZ9YY?autoplay=1\"><img src=\"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/88Cu_DiZ9YY/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YouTube video thumbnail\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" /></div></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Installation</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>Drag and drop 7z contents in your root directory of SPT game.</p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.8.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 795, "published_at": "2025-06-01T19:00:50.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1895/sain-twitch-players/1.8.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.8.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 818, "published_at": "2025-06-06T20:18:03.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1895/sain-twitch-players/1.8.1", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.8.2", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 1075, "published_at": "2025-06-17T09:03:04.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1895/sain-twitch-players/1.8.2", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.9.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 386, "published_at": "2025-07-14T10:26:36.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/1895/sain-twitch-players/1.9.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.9.1", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 397, "published_at": "2025-07-17T06:18:02.000000Z", "forge_link"